# The Flathub commits a Flatpak build of the Linux app installs (ADR 0139 decision 2), one line each:
# `<id>/<arch>/<branch> <commit>`. `run.py flatpak` installs each ref and moves it to this commit
# (`flatpak update --commit=`); the manifest names only the branch. validate_build_input_pins.py (check 7) holds the
# Platform's and the Sdk's branch to the manifest's `runtime-version` and every commit to 64 hex, for both architectures.
# Read with `flatpak remote-info flathub <id>//<branch> --arch=<arch>` on 2026-11-13; a bump is a new read of the same.
# org.flatpak.Builder is not built from: it carries flatpak-builder-lint, the manifest's and the repo's lint.
